# What `bun fmt` leaves alone, and why. Reasons and measurements:
# docs/migration/bun-fmt.md. Gitignore syntax; a comment must be on its own
# line.
#
# Run the formatter through tooling/js/fmt.sh. bun fmt reads this file and
# the root .gitignore only, not the nested .gitignore files, so the wrapper
# hands it git's own file list. The build-output section at the end repeats
# the nested ignores for a direct `bun fmt` run.

