# --- Adobe ExtendScript (ES3, run inside InDesign/Illustrator/Photoshop). --
# Prettier writes ES5+ syntax (trailing commas in object literals and calls)
# that ExtendScript may not parse, and nothing in CI can run them. Every
# .jsx file here is ExtendScript; React code is .tsx.
**/*.jsx

